# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak

# IDE / editor
/.idea/
/.vscode/
*.iml
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
# Obsidian per-vault editor state (workspace layout, enabled plugins, appearance,
# graph view). The product is Obsidian-native, but these are personal per-machine
# editor config — same category as .idea/.vscode above. Unanchored so it matches
# .obsidian/ at any depth (repo root + wiki/).
.obsidian/

# Local workdir / state (mwe-mcp runtime)
/work/
/work_example/
/work-bridgetest/
/.mwe-mcp.lock
*.mwe-write-in-progress

# Claude Code session artefacts (runtime locks, scheduled-task state)
/.claude/

# Secrets / env
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Build artifacts (static assets compilati da tailwind)
# NOTE: the dashboard build output `crates/mwe-dashboard/assets/tailwind.css`
# IS committed — it is the source rust-embed pulls in at compile time, and
# Cargo cannot run the standalone tailwindcss CLI itself. Devs re-run
# `tailwindcss -i tailwind/app.css -o crates/mwe-dashboard/assets/tailwind.css --minify`
# after editing tailwind/ (see docs/development/build-run.md).
/static/tailwind.css

# Logs / temp
*.log
*.tmp
*.pid

# Test artifacts
/coverage/
/profraw/
*.profraw
*.profdata

# Playwright MCP scratch (snapshots, console logs, debug screenshots)
/.playwright-mcp/
/home-*.png
/phase*-*.png
/dogfood-*.png

# Dashboard runtime comment/submission cache (created at runtime, not source)
/.comment-md-cache/

# OS
Thumbs.db

# gitignored
/gitignored/
.secrets

# Historical design corpus — the frozen "road behind" archive. The whole
# Italian planning corpus lives here on disk as a reference of last resort;
# OUT of the tracked repo. Canonical current state lives in the engineering
# wiki (wiki/), forward work in wiki/roadmap.md. The nested road-behind/
# inside it is the deeper pre-0.2.0 layer.
/road-behind/
/work_qwen_35b/
/work_gemini_flash/
__pycache__/

# Maintainer-local material — never tracked in the public repo.
# Planning, roadmap drafts, decision logs, scratch notes live here
# locally; the public wiki (docs/) carries only what shipped.
/planning/
/notes/
